## Release output. `publish/` is what the installer packs; `dist/` is where iscc puts
## Sling-Setup.exe. Both are produced by the release workflow and by the commands in the
## README, and neither belongs in history - the licence is the reason it matters here and
## not only tidiness, since a committed build is a redistributed binary.
publish/
dist/

